 will\",\"x\":0.5504201716060588,\"y\":0.6873792659238844,\"width\":0.11134453352107565,\"height\":0.011748641211220434},{\"text\":\"rally around and support the\",\"x\":0.6638655478168028,\"y\":0.6860465117577056,\"width\":0.26050420716751455,\"height\":0.013081395234588844},{\"text\":\"new council in their efforts.\",\"x\":0.5504201700026908,\"y\":0.6728911786503307,\"width\":0.2352941184820131,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"The files need\",\"x\":0.8046218497912615,\"y\":0.6744186047108254,\"width\":0.11764705924100649,\"height\":0.011672831165045916},{\"text\":\"to be brought up to date, so we would be\",\"x\":0.5483193420933361,\"y\":0.658403090754329,\"width\":0.3760504008448402,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"narateful if all life-members and members of\",\"x\":0.5462184978735097,\"y\":0.6423052159243927,\"width\":0.3802520893895349,\"height\":0.01612501641818187},{\"text\":\"the former association would send in their\",\"x\":0.5483193414893445,\"y\":0.6336123631476445,\"width\":0.3760504008448402,\"height\":0.011736474341142666},{\"text\":\"names and addresses to be registered. We\",\"x\":0.550420174543113,\"y\":0.6177325585211557,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.01459197482215302},{\"text\":\"hope that greater contact will be kept with\",\"x\":0.5504201763393315,\"y\":0.6046361878387965,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"the members through Class Clubs, each of\",\"x\":0.548319332109001,\"y\":0.5885383130015927,\"width\":0.3781512593114098,\"height\":0.01611284954810399},{\"text\":\"which is entitled to send a representative\",\"x\":0.5504201772742053,\"y\":0.5784883722046532,\"width\":0.3739495707667152,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"to council meetings.\",\"x\":0.5483193350467357,\"y\":0.5639534884534421,\"width\":0.18487394111101008,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"We hope too that\",\"x\":0.7563025276614715,\"y\":0.5639534885018915,\"width\":0.17016805959302317,\"height\":0.013081395234588955},{\"text\":\"there will be a keen interest taken in the\",\"x\":0.5504201763393315,\"y\":0.5523255814960777,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"present school and its work.\",\"x\":0.5504201696428571,\"y\":0.5363372097445085,\"width\":0.25,\"height\":0.014534883321060788},{\"text\":\"It is very appropriate that we should\",\"x\":0.5924369727826592,\"y\":0.5173857048433892,\"width\":0.33193277048510184,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"have a strong and active Wah Yan Hong\",\"x\":0.5504201694835893,\"y\":0.5043604651128413,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"Kong Past Students Association this year\",\"x\":0.5525210102749059,\"y\":0.4912790700425894,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.01322833476953933},{\"text\":\"as Wah Yan celebrates its fiftieth anniver-\",\"x\":0.5504201839963474,\"y\":0.47810688986757877,\"width\":0.3760504008448401,\"height\":0.011718691661905978},{\"text\":\"sary on 19th December，\",\"x\":0.5523788361161442,\"y\":0.4621665549104954,\"width\":0.2419312375090843,\"height\":0.015261283476584508},{\"text\":\"1969.\",\"x\":0.8088235302102577,\"y\":0.46220930256185333,\"width\":0.056722688896711504,\"height\":0.014609757501389709},{\"text\":\"The\",\"x\":0.8886554628322498,\"y\":0.4636188024401976,\"width\":0.035714285207349206,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"School was first started on 19th December，\",\"x\":0.5504201828758991,\"y\":0.4505813956239847,\"width\":0.3760504008448402,\"height\":0.013081395234588844},{\"text\":\"1919 by Mr. Peter Tsui and Mr. Andrew\",\"x\":0.5525210115254529,\"y\":0.4359304570238298,\"width\":0.3718487406885901,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"Lim.\",\"x\":0.5504201675291251,\"y\":0.42296511649971147,\"width\":0.042016807378724486,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"We appeal therefore to all Wah Yan\",\"x\":0.5943345543474915,\"y\":0.4018674172868346,\"width\":0.3302378951671512,\"height\":0.01750953291127244},{\"text\":\"Past Students to make our Association a\",\"x\":0.5525210115254529,\"y\":0.3908564069981405,\"width\":0.3718487406885901,\"height\":0.011912427559562233},{\"text\":\"success by joining it and supporting its\",\"x\":0.5504201824294708,\"y\":0.37500000027260916,\"width\":0.3760504008448401,\"height\":0.01456857694784286},{\"text\":\"activities.\",\"x\":0.5503302851052456,\"y\":0.36306914065182705,\"width\":0.08001169603924418,\"height\":0.01223381150559466},{\"text\":\"Fr. R. Gallagher, the first Jesuit Prin-\",\"x\":0.5903361360313201,\"y\":0.3399871214194713,\"width\":0.33613445902979655,\"height\":0.016117529491417204},{\"text\":\"cipal of Wah Yan College, once said at the\",\"x\":0.548319333054379,\"y\":0.3270348841545184,\"width\":0.3781512593114099,\"height\":0.01598837140753273},{\"text\":\"inauguration of the Wah Yan Past Stu-\",\"x\":0.5504201824294708,\"y\":0.3154069770167952,\"width\":0.3760504008448401,\"height\":0.014599462363003024},{\"text\":\"dents\",\"x\":0.552521008761684,\"y\":0.3037790698755539,\"width\":0.04621848527775263,\"height\":0.011739281938679347},{\"text\":\"Association in 1935\",\"x\":0.6134453807423288,\"y\":0.3037790694879571,\"width\":0.19117645973383002,\"height\":0.011739281938679347},{\"text\":\"“Wah Yan\",\"x\":0.8172268915052708,\"y\":0.30521571124045765,\"width\":0.10714285207349206,\"height\":0.011644753961507881},{\"text\":\"College is your college. You as Wah Yan\",\"x\":0.5525210083841496,\"y\":0.2862202187788767,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.016105362007254098},{\"text\":\"students carry its name with you wherever\",\"x\":0.5504201796983783,\"y\":0.27462974883427327,\"width\":0.3760504008448401,\"height\":0.014614436830617694},{\"text\":\"you go.\",\"x\":0.552521009782957,\"y\":0.260141661565912,\"width\":0.08613445193268532,\"height\":0.011660664294968037},{\"text\":\"You have done honour to its\",\"x\":0.647058827857013,\"y\":0.26303927891643286,\"width\":0.2794117630359738,\"height\":0.011670023567509236},{\"text\":\"name in years gone by. Give it, by your\",\"x\":0.5525210151418525,\"y\":0.24694140354508587,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.01481004507405026},{\"text\":\"wholehearted loyalty to the Assoclation，\",\"x\":0.5546218633707823,\"y\":0.23401162786974017,\"width\":0.3697478822220204,\"height\":0.011641945749885863},{\"text\":\"still greater honour in the years to come.\\\"\",\"x\":0.554330975586508,\"y\":0.21883435019735864,\"width\":0.37041503906249995,\"height\":0.018698573803333618},{\"text\":\"Your Correspondence can be address-\",\"x\":0.5966386699623726,\"y\":0.20057952327567008,\"width\":0.329831912018532,\"height\":0.014536755666837209},{\"text\":\"ed to：\",\"x\":0.5525210082664813,\"y\":0.18737926599655896,\"width\":0.05462184817291971,\"height\":0.011748641211220545},{\"text\":\"The Secretary，\",\"x\":0.6361465515899337,\"y\":0.15501326146229477,\"width\":0.12910450070403345,\"height\":0.015066657155387575},{\"text\":\"Wah Yan Hong Kong Past\",\"x\":0.6386554681694061,\"y\":0.13940759812473313,\"width\":0.24579831145530529,\"height\":0.013208680972696785},{\"text\":\"Students Association Ltd.，\",\"x\":0.6806722765865274,\"y\":0.12354651166686259,\"width\":0.2373949485601381,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"c\\/o Wah Yan College，\",\"x\":0.6386554706030831,\"y\":0.1061046513627254,\"width\":0.20588234125181681,\"height\":0.01462941191231748},{\"text\":\"Queen's Road East, Hong Kong.\",\"x\":0.6386554631755667,\"y\":0.09011627929877197,\"width\":0.28991597020348836,\"height\":0.014534883321060788},{\"text\":\"34\",\"x\":0.13445378206816688,\"y\":0.05956213806129562,\"width\":0.023109242638876287,\"height\":0.013200257566001294}]",
