ll\",\"x\":0.5504201716060588,\"y\":0.6873792659238844,\"width\":0.11134453352107565,\"height\":0.011748641211220434},{\"text\":\"rally around and support the\",\"x\":0.6638655478168028,\"y\":0.6860465117577056,\"width\":0.26050420716751455,\"height\":0.013081395234588844},{\"text\":\"new council in their efforts.\",\"x\":0.5504201700026908,\"y\":0.6728911786503307,\"width\":0.2352941184820131,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"The files need\",\"x\":0.8046218497912615,\"y\":0.6744186047108254,\"width\":0.11764705924100649,\"height\":0.011672831165045916},{\"text\":\"to be brought up to date, so we would be\",\"x\":0.5483193420933361,\"y\":0.658403090754329,\"width\":0.3760504008448402,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"narateful if all life-members and members of\",\"x\":0.5462184978735097,\"y\":0.6423052159243927,\"width\":0.3802520893895349,\"height\":0.01612501641818187},{\"text\":\"the former association would send in their\",\"x\":0.5483193414893445,\"y\":0.6336123631476445,\"width\":0.3760504008448402,\"height\":0.011736474341142666},{\"text\":\"names and addresses to be registered. We\",\"x\":0.550420174543113,\"y\":0.6177325585211557,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.01459197482215302},{\"text\":\"hope that greater contact will be kept with\",\"x\":0.5504201763393315,\"y\":0.6046361878387965,\"width\":0.3739495707667151,\"height\":0.013200257566001294},{\"text\":\"the members through Class Clubs, each of\",\"x\":0.548319332109001,\"y\":0.5885383130015927,\"width\":0.3781512593114098,\"height\":0.01611284954810399},{\"text\":\"which is entitled to send a representative\",\"x\":0.5504201772742053,\"y\":0.5784883722046532,\"width\":0.3739495707667152,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"to council meetings.\",\"x\":0.5483193350467357,\"y\":0.5639534884534421,\"width\":0.18487394111101008,\"height\":0.013081395234588733},{\"text\":\"We hope too that\",\"x\":0.7563025276614715,\"y\":0.5639534885018915,\"width\":0.1701680595930